            {
              "name": "HowKeys", "type": "HBoxContainer", "variation": "ToyRowThirtyTwo", "states": ["step-keys"], "note": "The Controls lesson: the bound keys of walking, sprinting and jumping, each group followed by its action name; it advances once the player has moved. Each keycap shows the label of its action's binding as a data text (DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(), #211; auto_translate_mode DISABLED); Space is key.space. Shift and Space keycaps take the wide size.",
